      x: '<p>Hobbilar haqida gaplashganda Perfect Continuous juda foydali: I <b>took up</b> photography last year and I’<b>ve been taking</b> photos every weekend since then.</p><p><b>take up</b> — boshlamoq (hobbi), <b>give up</b> — tashlamoq, <b>be into</b> / <b>be keen on</b> — qiziqmoq, <b>join a club</b> — to‘garakka qo‘shilmoq, <b>practise</b> — mashq qilmoq.</p><p><b class="rd">Yodda tuting:</b> be keen on / be into dan keyin <b>-ing</b> keladi: I’m keen on <b>swimming</b>.</p>',
